{"type":"message","id":"d5e79156","parentId":"e50d62fa","timestamp":"2026-03-23T23:43:32.037Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is sending a heartbeat message. According to the instructions:\n1. I need to read HEARTBEAT.md if it exists (workspace context)\n2. Follow it strictly\n3. Do not infer or repeat old tasks from prior chats\n4. If nothing needs attention, reply HEARTBEAT_OK\n\nThe user explicitly says to use the workspace file /workspace/projects/workspace/HEARTBEAT.md (exact case).\n\nFrom the workspace context already provided, I can see HEARTBEAT.md exists and contains:\n\n```markdown\n# Heartbeat - 每日交易信号扫描\n\n## 🎯 心跳任务\n\n每次心跳时执行以下检查:\n\n### 1. 信息扫描\n- [ ] 扫描市场新闻 (加密货币/美股/宏观)\n- [ ] 检查财报日历 (今日/明日)\n- [ ] 获取恐惧贪婪指数\n\n### 2. 信号生成\n- [ ] 更新技术面指标\n- [ ] 检查预设品种的信号\n- [ ] 记录新信号到 signals/\n\n### 3. 模拟账户\n- [ ] 更新持仓价格\n- [ ] 计算当日 P&L\n- [ ] 检查止损/止盈是否触发\n\n### 4. 报告生成\n- [ ] 生成每日信号报告 (22:00)\n- [ ] 更新 performance.json\n\n---\n\n## 📅 扫描时间\n\n| 时间 | 任务 | 内容 |\n|------|------|------|\n| 08:00 | 早盘扫描 | 隔夜新闻,亚洲市场 |\n| 12:00 | 午盘扫描 | 午间更新,欧洲开盘 |\n| 18:00 | 晚盘扫描 | 美股盘中,财报更新 |\n\n\n| 22:00 | 夜盘扫描 | 收盘数据,每日报告 |\n\n心跳配置版本: 1.0\n```\n\nThe heartbeat schedule is clear, with specific tasks at 22:00 for night market scanning. Current time is 7:43 AM in Shanghai (23:43 UTC), which is outside the scheduled scanning times. I'll determine if any attention is needed based on the predefined scan intervals.\n\nThe night scan time (22:00) hasn't arrived yet, so no specific tasks are pending. Consequently, the appropriate response is HEARTBEAT_OK.\n\nThe instructions emphasize following the heartbeat file's specific guidelines without inferring additional tasks from previous interactions. This confirms my current approach of waiting for the designated scan time.\n\nI'll verify the presence of required directories and files to ensure smooth report generation when the time arrives. The key steps involve creating necessary paths and confirming their structure.\n\nChecking for signals/, reports/daily/, and paper-trading/ directories will prevent potential file creation issues during the scheduled heartbeat process.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"HEARTBEAT_OK"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"coze","model":"auto","usage":{"input":7117,"output":1180,"cacheRead":14016,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":22313,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774309402502}}
